      "description": "* Now supports Apple Pay & PayPal*\n\nPowered by the UK's biggest event discovery platform, the Skiddle app is now available for iPhone.\n\n * Get personalised event recommendations and tickets from the UK’s largest events guide.\n\n * Never miss out on an event near you by discovering club nights, gigs and festivals on your doorstep. \n \n* Buy tickets in just a few clicks with Apple Pay and have them delivered straight to your phone in seconds.\n\n* Track artists using our Apple Music and Spotify sync and get alerted when your favourite bands/DJs play near you.\n\nFar flung festivals, the wildest underground raves, and gigs with the hottest bands on the planet. These are the events we all live for, and the new Skiddle app makes attending them even easier, bringing everything to the palm of your hands. From tickets to taxis, we’ve streamlined the complexities of your perfect night out, weekend away or festival to a touch of a button. \n\nWith personal  recommendations pulled from the UK’s largest what’s on guide, you’ll never miss out on the best events tailor made for you. Still not sure? Then listen to a clip from your favourite artists on the spot to see if they get you in the groove and craving more.\n\nOnce you’ve picked out an event, you can buy tickets with just a few clicks. And what’s more is that they’re downloaded straight to your phone, making losing tickets a thing of the past.",
